(7106640, 1083227, 138630, '<td valign="top">I didn''t have time to bump to 8''s, 9''s and 10''s but this got one of my few 7''s.  I do agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=97225" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jomari</a> and I would at least have colored them quite dark - as well as the small cluster of white stones against the frame right side just above the midpoint.  Wonderful picture though and not just for the challenge</td>', 'I didn''t have time to bump to 8''s, 9''s and 10''s but this got one of my few 7''s.  I do agree with  jomari and I would at least have colored them quite dark - as well as the small cluster of white stones against the frame right side just above the midpoint.  Wonderful picture though and not just for the challenge', '2013-09-25 01:10:25.000000', NULL, 0),
